  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.5.3-beta.8`\n\n### Fixes\n\n- grow unlimited scrollback with its content instead of reserving ten million lines per terminal, and let go of the lines a clear drops, keeping the scroll regions running programs set ([0edc52ac](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/0edc52ac2c4cf730b8a139c8f673432ffcda64e2))\n- stop pinning xterm's atlas page canvases in the font host, so pages the canvas renderer replaces as its glyph atlas grows can be collected instead of piling up hundreds of megabytes ([646de472](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/646de472c54582ceeef49b8e1326b3090c534659))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.5.3-beta.8...v0.5.3-beta.9](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.5.3-beta.8...v0.5.3-beta.9)\n",
